<p>You automatically adjust your Paradox <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">1.12, 1.77, 2.26, 2.66, 3.00</acronym> points towards your preferred Paradox each turn.</p><p>While using Spacetime Tuning twice this value will instead be added to the amount you would normally tune.</p>